# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CATENA — local development secrets  (Cloudflare Workers / Pages)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# `.dev.vars` is read automatically by `wrangler pages dev` and injected as
# `c.env` inside the Hono app (src/api/index.ts). It is gitignored — never
# commit real keys.
#
# EVERY VALUE HERE IS OPTIONAL. The dashboard is fully functional with this file
# absent: each key upgrades one panel from a deterministic, explicitly-labelled
# fallback to a live upstream. `env` is normalised to `{}` everywhere
# (src/lib/supabase.ts, src/lib/inference.ts), so a missing key degrades — it
# never throws.
#
# What is live WITHOUT any key at all (no registration, CORS-open, verified):
#   Open-Meteo weather ........... api.open-meteo.com
#   Open-Meteo air quality ....... air-quality-api.open-meteo.com
#   openFDA adverse events ....... api.fda.gov
#   Europe PMC literature ........ www.ebi.ac.uk        (PubMed mirror)
#   Population health ............ disease.sh
#
# For PRODUCTION on Cloudflare Pages, do NOT ship this file. Use:
#   npx wrangler pages secret put GROQ_API_KEY --project-name <project>
# (repeat per key). On Vercel/Netlify these belong in the dashboard's env UI —
# but note the static Vercel target has no server, so keys there are unused;
# see README → "Which deploy target reads these".


# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. USDA_API_KEY  — Nutrition panel
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Affects  : /api/nutrition  (dashboard → Nutrition view)
# Get it   : https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-key-signup   (free, instant, no card)
# Without  : the panel uses a deterministic per-food estimator and is labelled
#            non-live in the provenance strip, with the real reason
#            "no USDA_API_KEY".
# IMPORTANT: do NOT put the literal `DEMO_KEY` here. The shared demo key is
#            globally rate-limited and answers HTTP 429 for this endpoint
#            (verified), so src/lib/sources.ts treats DEMO_KEY as "no key" and
#            skips the request rather than burning a call that cannot succeed.
USDA_API_KEY=


# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. LLM providers — Agent Swarm + Draft/Verify Cascade
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Affects  : /api/swarm, /api/cascade, /api/health, /api/saas
#            (dashboard → Swarm, Cascade views)
# Without  : the swarm runs the DETERMINISTIC graph reasoner over the personal
#            causal graph. Every panel still renders real numbers derived from
#            the twin; the provenance strip reports "deterministic graph
#            reasoner (no provider key)" and the live chip reads degraded.
# Single provider: GroqCloud. Models: openai/gpt-oss-120b (primary draft) and
# qwen/qwen3.6-27b (agentic/multi-call). Outbound calls are capped at 3/min.

# GroqCloud — https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=


# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. Supabase — twin persistence (Postgres + pgvector)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Affects  : /api/overview (observation recency), /api/memory (storage budget),
#            /api/health  (supabase: true|false)
# Get it   : https://supabase.com  → new project → Settings → API
# Schema   : psql "$DB_URL" -f supabase/schema.sql
# Without  : the twin is COMPUTED per request from the live environment plus a
#            stable per-user seed — deterministic and reproducible, so the
#            dashboard is fully functional before any database exists.
#            supabaseConfigured() requires SUPABASE_URL *and* one of the keys;
#            with either missing every call resolves to null (no throw).
SUPABASE_URL=
# Prefer the anon key: this app only ever SELECTs. Use the service key solely if
# you enable server-side upserts (sbUpsert) with RLS that requires it.
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=
